{
  "_id": "zlLTYwA98imjAPWY",
  "name": "小丑面具 Jester's Mask (BMT)",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "36",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><p><em>奇物，傳說（需吟遊詩人、術士或邪術師同調）</em><br />這款色彩繽紛的多米諾花紋小丑面具的邊緣鑲有珍珠。着裝此面具後，你獲得以下增益： <br /><em><strong>魅力焦點Charismatic Focus。</strong></em>你可以將面具作爲施展法術的法器。你在任何使用魅力作爲施法能力的法術攻擊檢定和法術豁免DC上獲得+3加值。<br /><em><strong>非凡逃脫Marvelous Escape。</strong></em>當一個生物的攻擊檢定命中你時，你可以用一個反應消失在一陣煙霧和彩色閃光之中。你不會因此次攻擊受到任何傷害，而是連同你穿着或攜帶的任何物件一起傳送到一個你可以看到的30尺內的未被佔據的空間。此反應一經使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。<br /><em><strong>顛倒黑白Topsy-Turvy。</strong></em>當你在[[/r d20]]上擲出1時，你可以將該擲骰視爲擲出20。此項屬性一經使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。</p><p><em>(requires attunement by a bard, sorcerer, or warlock)</em></p></div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>This colorful, harlequin domino mask is edged with pearls. While wearing this mask, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Charismatic Focus\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Charismatic Focus.</span> You can use the mask as a spellcasting focus. You gain a +3 bonus to any spell attack rolls and spell saving throw DCs that use Charisma as the spellcasting ability.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Marvelous Escape\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Marvelous Escape.</span> When a creature hits you with an attack roll, you can use your reaction to disappear in a puff of smoke and colorful sparkles. You take no damage and instead teleport, along with anything you are wearing or carrying, to an unoccupied space you can see within 30 feet of yourself. Once this reaction is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Topsy-Turvy\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Topsy-Turvy.</span> When you roll a 1 on a [[/r d20]], you can treat the roll as if you rolled a 20 instead. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></li></ul></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
